  "description": "Transaction signing vectors from the Trezor firmware device tests (commit 5fdc180b99bd). The Trezor test mnemonic is 12 x \"all\" with no passphrase. The previous transactions come from Trezor's tests/txcache. The unsigned transaction of each vector is the signed one with its input scripts and witness removed, and the input paths are the Trezor address_n paths relative to the account, so hw must reproduce the signed transaction byte for byte (RFC6979 nonces, low S). Excluded: tests whose transaction duplicates another one (test_fee_high_warning, test_one_one_fee_back_from_amount, test_attack_change_outputs, test_send_bch_oldaddr), multisig and Taproot tests, and tests without a serialized transaction.",
